 "La cifra entra sola con redoble. Sirve para justificar por qué todo el sistema está organizado contra el reloj.": "The figure comes in by itself with a drumroll. It explains why the whole system is organised against the clock.",
 "1,9 MILLONES": "1.9 MILLION",
 "de neuronas se pierden <b style=\"color:#ff2d3d\">cada minuto</b> de un ictus isquémico grande sin tratar": "neurons are lost <b style=\"color:#ff2d3d\">every minute</b> of an untreated large ischaemic stroke",
